ffectively, so the user gets the information they need in a timely manner. I'll keep that urgency in mind as I work on providing those answers.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Blood in the urine plus burning makes a **urinary tract source** more concerning now, but with your **kidney cancer and CKD history**, it is still important not to assume this is a simple infection.\n\nPlease answer the **remaining questions**:\n1. Any **fever, chills, nausea, vomiting, loss of appetite, or weight loss**?\n2. Are you still taking **sunitinib**, and when did the fatigue start relative to treatment?\n3. Have you had any **recent CT/ultrasound, oncology follow-up, creatinine/eGFR, or hemoglobin** results after March 10?\n4. On a **0–10 scale**, how severe is the pain, and is it **constant or intermittent**?\n\nIf you also have **fever, worsening pain, vomiting, or reduced urine output**, you should seek **urgent same-day medical evaluation**.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02bc3a321a4aa4d20169b98502eb608191a5d68d463a42350c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":306,"output":211,"cacheRead":36096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36613,"cost":{"input":0.0007650000000000001,"output":0.0031650000000000003,"cacheRead":0.009023999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012954}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773765888109}}
