**fever, chills, nausea, vomiting, or reduced urine output**?\n\nIf you develop **fever, vomiting, severe/worsening pain, or trouble passing urine**, seek **urgent same-day care / emergency evaluation**.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02bc3a321a4aa4d20169b98519ecc8819196124c5459d3e3a8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":508,"output":232,"cacheRead":36224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36964,"cost":{"input":0.00127,"output":0.00348,"cacheRead":0.009056,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013805999999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773765911296}}
